- 2026-11-04 / Original startup and remembered infinite-battery console:
  User requested new branding and a Game Boy-inspired startup, first visit off,
  on/off intent surviving refresh and only explicit physical off. Drew original
  SVG logo/favicon and LCD reveal, synthesized a separate original chime, and
  respected mute/volume/reduced motion. No video, BIOS, logo or recording reused.
  Separate powered from running. Add checked device store in database v2 for
